# Repli completion-only supplement v1 — common Yoruba, Hausa and Igbo words as typed without tone marks.
# completion-only: these complete while typing but do not count as known words for autocorrect,
# so an English typo that happens to spell one ("ara" for "are") is still fixed; a user who
# types the word and keeps it teaches the adaptive model, which then protects it.
